1
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:05,350
The chart shows the instrument you picked in your watchlist.

2
00:00:05,450 --> 00:00:09,210
Each candle is one slice of time. Green means the price went up, red means down.

3
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:13,070
Prices run down the right-hand side. The tag shows the live price.

4
00:00:13,170 --> 00:00:15,930
Time runs along the bottom.

5
00:00:16,030 --> 00:00:18,650
Click the timeframe button to change how long each candle covers.

6
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:25,530
Pick 5m: every candle is five minutes.

7
00:00:25,630 --> 00:00:31,250
1h gives a wider view, one candle per hour. Daily, weekly and monthly are further down.

8
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:33,300
These buttons along the bottom set how far back you look.

9
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:38,620
5D shows the last five days.

10
00:00:38,720 --> 00:00:44,840
1D brings you back to today.

11
00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:50,360
Pick 1m again for one-minute candles.

